    .desc = The Syndicate Lightly Armored Yet Explosive Resistant Overcoat, or S.L.A.Y.E.R. Overcoat for short, is Gorlex Entertainment's only overcoat capable of protecting the wearer's limbs from explosive damage, if worn over the shoulders. Its interior is lined with hooks. Comes with proprietary technology that allows it to patch into Nanotrasen systems like a camera. Not for the faint of heart.